\b\f1\insrsid8014045  If y = Y / L, where, Y = Total GDP, L = Population, y = Per capita GDP then prove that Growth rate of per capita income = Growth rate of total output - Growth rate of population
\par 
\par ANSWER:
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 y = Y / L
\par Where,
\par \bullet  Y = Total GDP
\par \bullet  L = Population
\par \bullet  y = Per capita GDP
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 Taking log of both sides
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 \bullet  ln y = ln Y \endash  ln L
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 Taking derivative }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\ai\af42\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\i\f42\fs22\insrsid8014045 w.r.t. }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 time}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 
\par \bullet  1/y (dy/dt) = (dY/dt)/Y \endash  (dL/dt)/L
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af41\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f41\fs22\insrsid8014045 gy = gY \endash  gL
\par 
