\b\insrsid8014045  What are the different borrowing options available to the government for reducing the fiscal deficit?}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8014045 
\par     }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 By borrowing locally (i.e. issuing bonds), foreign financing (including non-relpayable grants) or printing
\par money (i.e. borrowing from the central bank). The first of these methods is least inflationary while the last
\par one is most inflationary.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid8014045 
\par Question No: 52    ( Marks: 5 ) 
