\b\f1\insrsid8014045  What are the conditions in which foreign exchange market exists? Also give some examples of foreign exchange markets.
\par 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid8014045 In a market there are buyers and sellers who negotiate and agree on the price for the or

\par price for the commodity being exchanged. The foreign exchange market is no different.
\par whatever, here the commodity being traded is foreign exchange and the price is the foreign exchange rate. Specifically, a foreign currency is being traded for the Pakistani Ruppee  at a particular rate of exchange.
\par The sellers and buyers of foreign exchange are not mutually exclusive. The
\par sellers of today, may be the buyers of tomorrow, or even of today.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid8014045 CONDITION:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid8014045 
\par Foreign exchange market exists when }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid8014045 buyers and sellers}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid8014045  exit and ready to sell and buy.
\par The }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\cf1\insrsid8014045 main driving force}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid8014045  for foreign exchange market is the law of supply and demand.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\ul\cf1\insrsid8014045 EXAMPLE:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \cf1\insrsid8014045 
\par  US $-PAK RS      Foregin exchange market
\par            US $ - UK POUND  Foregin exchange market
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\tx720\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid8014045 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid8014045     }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\insrsid8014045 Q}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 
