\f1\fs20\insrsid8014045 means }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8014045 the state of being poor; lack of the means of providing material needs or comforts.
\par According to }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid8014045 Prebisch-Singer hypothesis following are the reason of poverty in developing countries:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af3 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid8014045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li720\ri0\sb100\sa100\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnf3 {\pntxtb \'b7}}
\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8014045 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid8014045 One of the reson for poverty is increasing population.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \af3 \ltrch\fcs0 \f3\insrsid8014045 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \'b7\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-720\li720\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlbody\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnf3 {\pntxtb \'b7}}
\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid8014045 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid8014045 Another reason }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af41\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f41\fs22\insrsid8014045 Lack of precious natural resources (like oil, gold, gas, iron, copper etc.) }
{\rtlch\fcs1 \af39\afs22 \ltrch\fcs0 \f39\fs22\insrsid8014045 was also cited by some as the reason for LICs\rquote  continued poverty.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \insrsid8014045 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af1\afs20 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\fs20\insrsid8014045 
